    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boundary is a strategy game in which a team that builds a fence out of wood and occupies more land wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can earn wood from a wood miner, and you can upgrade your wood miner or purchase items in the store by earning coins every time you take up land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the opposing team from building fences or our team builds more fences to lead the team to victory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
